<%#
# Rich Text Form Partial

This partial renders a rich text area element for rich text attributes.

## Local variables:

- `f`:
  A Rails form generator, used to help create the appropriate input fields.
- `field`:
  An instance of [Administrate::Field::RichText][1].
  A wrapper around the Rich Text pulled from the database.

[1]: http://www.rubydoc.info/gems/administrate/Administrate/Field/RichText
%>

<div class="field-unit__label">
  <%= f.label field.attribute, "#{field.attribute.to_s.humanize}#{field.required? ? ' *' : ''}", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" %>
</div>
<div class="field-unit__field">
  <%= f.rich_text_area field.attribute, data: { controller: "mentions", target: "mentions.field" }, class: "block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-indigo-500 sm:text-sm" %>
</div>
